    "commit_body": "Captures the full Q1/Q3/Q5 inverted-U cohort signal in weekly-volume features:\nLIFT moderate-positive force (Q3 anti-climax accumulation, +8.96pp WR15 peak)\nplus DAMPEN extreme-positive force (Q5 climax exhaustion). CLIMAX_THRESH=0.05\nshields the high-quality Q3 sweet spot from dampening \u2014 only Q5 climax\n(force1 > 0.05) gets dampened. Pure score-stage gradient, no labels, no tier\noverrides. Architecturally consistent with v37 PCD / v38 CWWD / v39 PESS /\nv43 MCD / v44 ICH.\n\nApply order in compute_overall_score: AFTER ICH, BEFORE PESS / EARN_BOOST.\n\nPer-trade gate (5y v45 baseline, 30dte_opt @ w=15 AND w=30):\n  Call 75+: +1.11pp WR15 / +1.18pp WR30 (-7.1% N) \u2014 6/6 cells positive\n  Call 80+: +0.56pp / +0.53pp (-7.8% N) \u2014 5/6 positive\n  Call 85+: +1.27pp / +2.54pp (-18.5% N) \u2014 5/6 positive\n  Call 90+: +7.45pp / +9.41pp (-21.6% N) \u2014 6/6 positive\n\nPortfolio MC N=300 \u00d7 22-now+5y vs v45 baseline (apples-to-apples):\n  22-now Worst DD: 72.0% \u2192 68.4% (-3.6pp)\n  22-now Median compound: +25%\n  5y Mean compound: +1.40e24% \u2192 +5.27e24% (3.77\u00d7, +277%)\n  5y Median compound: +25%\n  P(coll) = 0% all cells.\n\nCalibration: experiments/weekly_volume/wave_sweep.py (4608 variants, top-1).\nSee REPORT_v45_wave.md for full investigation writeup.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
